   "text": "• Patient has pallor if s/he has pale conjunctiva or palms. Compare patient’s palms to your own. • Check Hb: anaemia likely if: - Non-pregnant woman has Hb < 12. Pregnant woman has Hb < 11 178. - Man has Hb < 13.",
