   "parent": null,
   "text": "Approach to the patient with pallor/anaemia not needing urgent attention • Test for HIV 124 and check for TB 102. • Check for pregnancy 174. • If fever now or in past 3 days, and in a malaria area in past 3 months, malaria likely 39. • If not pregnant, send full blood count (FBC) and manage further according to mean cell volume (MCV)3 result:",
