   "text": "• Ask about abnormal vaginal bleeding: if abnormal 73. • Give ferrous sulphate compound BPC 170mg or ferrous fumarate 200mg 12 hourly with food. If not tolerated (abdominal pain, nausea, vomiting, constipation), give instead ferrous sulphate compound BPC 340mg or ferrous fumarate 400mg once weekly with food.",
   "bbox": [
    111.2,
    392.5,
    460.1,
    433.4
