   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "- Repeat Hb monthly on treatment: if Hb decreases or if no better after 4 weeks, refer. - Continue treatment until 3 months after Hb reaches normal value. • Advise: - To eat foods rich in iron: liver, kidney, meat, eggs, spinach, beans, peas, lentils, nuts, dried fruit",
   "bbox": [
    111.2,
    433.2,
    463.4,
    473.4
   ],
   "key": "p44-1ab4867c"
  },
  {
   "id": "p44-out-e18",
   "page": 44,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "and fortified cereals. Foods rich in vitamin C help iron absorption: guavas, peppers, oranges, strawberries, broccoli, cauliflower. - Avoid drinking tea/coffee with meals as these interfere with iron absorption. Also avoid taking",
   "bbox": [
    116.9,
    473.2,
    467.1,
    503.4
   ],
   "key": "p44-afcae097"
  },
  {
