   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "iron tablets with milk or calcium tablets. - Warn that stools may become black with treatment, reassure this is normal.",
   "bbox": [
