   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Folate deficiency likely • Give folate 5mg daily until Hb normal. • Repeat Hb monthly on treatment: if Hb decreases or if no better after 4 weeks, refer. • Advise to eat foods rich in folic acid: liver, eggs, fortified cereals, citrus fruit, spinach, other green vegetables, lentils, dry beans, peanuts. • Avoid alcohol 165. • If chronic diarrhoea, refer.",
   "bbox": [
    583.9,
    402.2,
    736.0,
    523.2
   ],
   "key": "p44-58591865"
  },
